cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Analysis code: Post-release behaviour and rehabilitation success in European hedgehogs"
abstract: >-
  R analysis pipeline for a study on the post-release behaviour and
  rehabilitation success of 26 rehabilitated European hedgehogs
  (Erinaceus europaeus) released at a single study site in Sachsenhagen,
  Lower Saxony, Germany, and tracked with an automated VHF telemetry
  (reverse-GPS / multilateration) system.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Steiner
    given-names: Natalie
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5057-1173"
    affiliation: "University of Veterinary Medicine Hannover (TiHo)"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-07-29"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/nataliesteiner/hedgehog-post_release_success_VHF"
keywords:
  - hedgehog
  - Erinaceus europaeus
  - VHF telemetry
  - multilateration
  - rehabilitation
  - post-release monitoring
  - movement ecology
  - chronobiology
